  "description": "YITAMOTOR Cargo/Trunk Liner are made with non-toxic and odorless TPE material, ensuring 100% safety even in extreme hot weather.\nFitment\n2010-2024 Toyota 4Runner Standard Models;\nONLY Fits 5 Passenger Models;\nNotes: No 3rd seat or No Sliding Cargo Deck;\n(If your car has a hook, you can cut it to the right size)\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: YITAMOTOR Cargo Mats Fit for 2010-2024 Toyota 4Runner(ONLY Fits 5 Passenger Models, No 3rd seat or No Sliding Cargo Deck), with vinyl floors. 3D laser scanning technology gives full protection to both the front and back for toyota 4runner accessories.\nSafe & Durable: YITAMOTOR Cargo/Trunk Liner are made with odorless TPE material, ensuring safety even in extreme hot weather. The product contains no latex, cadmium, lead, or any harmful PVC’s. High tensity TPE material not only provides a superb feel and extreme wear-resistance, but also remains flexible in even the harshest of cold weather.\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: The unique designed channels and raised edge can effectively trap liquids, snow, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean. Even in wet conditions, the hooks can effectively protect the mats from slipping. The mats are available for you\nEasy To Clean: The textured skid-resistant surface is easily cleaned. Neither cumbersome vacuum cleaners nor harsh chemicals are needed; simply shake them out or spray them down with a hose.\nWhy Choose Yitamotor: Our floor mats are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guard to your vehicle.",
